  "handoff": {
    "plan": "starter_template:\n  mode: none\n  rationale: No catalog template covers a voice keyword gate sequence over a painted road; build from\n    scratch reusing the Mamamy brand kit, record-start and result patterns from Game 1/2.\nmechanic_rationale: \"The client mockups (MMM SBD Effect 3 1-4) and the user's answers pin the loop\n  down: one near gate with a word, the player says it, the gate passes; voice only, no timer, no\n  music, so no catalog mechanic is borrowed.\"\ngame_type:\n  camera_feed: visible\n  ar_tracking: none\n  core_loop_seconds: 3\n  total_duration_seconds: 25\ncamera_feed_constraints:\n  tracking_type: none\n  tracking_range: not applicable - camera feed is only the backdrop\n  user_image_visible: true\n  composition: none\nmechanic:\n  class: other\n  description: A winding road covers the lower half of the screen. The near gate (large, left) shows a\n    word and a small baby; the far gate (small, right) previews the next word. A big baby in the\n    bottom-right is the near gate's baby. The microphone KeywordDetector listens for the near gate's\n    word; when it is heard the near gate grows and fades past the camera, the far gate glides\n    forward to become the near gate, a new far gate appears, and the big baby swaps. Order EAT, POO,\n    SLEEP, CRY, PEE, NINETEEN; after NINETEEN the MEGA MAMAMY 19 logo with confetti and PLAY AGAIN.\n    No timer, no losing, no tap fallback; a hint appears after a silence.\n  parameters:\n    words:\n      - eat\n      - poo\n      - sleep\n      - cry\n      - pee\n      - nineteen\n    hint_after_sec: 4\n    input: microphone KeywordDetector only\nscreens:\n  - name: Intro\n    role: intro\n    initial_visible: true\n    layout:\n      - id: intro_hint\n        element: brand text 'Đọc to từ trên cổng!'\n        position: center, y=+150\n        kind: hud\n      - id: intro_button\n        element: brand pink pill RECORD TO PLAY\n        position: center, y=+60\n        size: 343x62\n        kind: button\n        interactive: true\n  - name: Gameplay\n    role: gameplay\n    initial_visible: true\n    layout:\n      - id: road\n        element: white winding road (TACH HINH 1)\n        position: lower half, full width\n        kind: decoration\n      - id: gate_far\n        element: next gate, small\n        position: right, around (+125,+80), scale 0.5\n        kind: playable\n      - id: gate_near\n        element: current gate with word + small baby\n        position: left, (-80,-230)\n        size: 482x330\n        kind: playable\n      - id: big_baby\n        element: near gate's baby, large\n        position: bottom-right (+160,-400)\n        kind: playable\n      - id: say_hint\n        element: brand text hint after silence\n        position: center, y=+230\n        kind: hud\n  - name: Result\n    role: result\n    initial_visible: false\n    layout:\n      - id: result_logo\n        element: MEGA MAMAMY 19 logo\n        position: center, y=+100\n        kind: result\n      - id: retry_button\n        element: pink pill PLAY AGAIN\n        position: center, y=-60\n        kind: button\n        interactive: true\n      - id: confetti\n        element: Sparkly Confetti\n        position: full screen\n        kind: decoration\ninteractions:\n  - kind: record_start_reset\n    trigger: APJS.EventType.RecordStart\n    response: Reset to EAT and start listening\n    state_change: any -> LISTENING\n    target:\n      scope: none\n      rationale: global lifecycle event\n  - kind: screen_transition\n    trigger: tap RECORD TO PLAY in INTRO\n    response: Same as record start\n    state_change: INTRO -> LISTENING\n    target:\n      scope: screen_element\n      screen_element_ids:\n        - intro_button\n    feedback:\n      visual: intro text hides\n  - kind: gameplay_action\n    trigger: KeywordHit containing the near gate's word\n    response: Near gate passes the camera, far gate moves to near, big baby swaps\n    state_change: LISTENING -> PASSING -> LISTENING, or RESULT after NINETEEN\n    target:\n      scope: screen_element\n      screen_element_ids:\n        - gate_near\n        - big_baby\n    feedback:\n      visual: gate grows and fades out, next gate glides forward, baby pops\n  - kind: retry\n    trigger: tap anywhere on RESULT after 1.3s\n    response: Restart from EAT\n    state_change: RESULT -> LISTENING\n    target:\n      scope: screen_element\n      screen_element_ids:\n        - retry_button\n    feedback:\n      visual: result hides\nassets:\n  - id: asset.road\n    role: background prop\n    description: White winding road from the TACH HINH 1 layer, bottom half of the screen\n    is_background: false\n    count: 1\n    animated: false\n    coverage: partial\n    interactive_role: decoration\n    kind: visual\n  - id: asset.gates\n    role: word gates\n    description: Six cream arches with purple word banners EAT POO SLEEP CRY PEE NINETEEN, each with a\n      small baby or the 19 shield\n    is_background: false\n    count: 6\n    animated: false\n    coverage: partial\n    interactive_role: addressable_part\n    kind: visual\n  - id: asset.babies\n    role: big babies\n    description: Five large babies plus the 19 shield shown in the bottom-right for the near gate\n    is_background: false\n    count: 6\n    animated: false\n    coverage: partial\n    interactive_role: decoration\n    kind: visual\n  - id: asset.logo\n    role: finale\n    description: MEGA MAMAMY 19 logo and Sparkly Confetti for the result\n    is_background: false\n    count: 1\n    animated: false\n    coverage: partial\n    interactive_role: decoration\n    kind: visual\nrandom_behaviors: []\ncriteria:\n  - category: layout\n    check: Road, gates and big baby sit where mockup 1 puts them\n  - category: state\n    check: Saying the near gate's word advances exactly one gate\n  - category: state\n    check: Saying another gate's word does nothing\n  - category: state\n    check: Big baby always matches the near gate\n  - category: state\n    check: After NINETEEN the result shows logo, confetti and PLAY AGAIN\n  - category: camera_feed\n    check: Camera feed visible above the road\nscene_representation:\n  planning_mode: explicit\n  decision_summary: Flat 2D screen-space scene over the camera feed; one APJS script drives gates\n    along a fixed far-to-near path and listens with KeywordDetector.\n  space:\n    kind: screen\n    description: 720x1280 ScreenTransform space, origin at center\n  content_form:\n    kind: flat_2d\n    description: PNG sprites on Screen Images\n  requirements:\n    - id: req.voice\n      description: Microphone keyword detection advances gates\n      must: true\n      layer_refs:\n        - layer.game\n      verification_refs:\n        - ver.voice\n    - id: req.flow\n      description: Six gates in order then MEGA MAMAMY 19 result\n      must: true\n      layer_refs:\n        - layer.game\n        - layer.ui\n      verification_refs:\n        - ver.voice\n    - id: req.camera\n      description: Camera feed visible\n      must: true\n      layer_refs:\n        - layer.camera\n      verification_refs:\n        - ver.voice\n  layers:\n    - id: layer.game\n      role: gameplay\n      description: Road, gates, big baby\n      space:\n        kind: screen\n        description: screen\n      content_form:\n        kind: flat_2d\n        description: flat_2d\n      requirement_refs:\n        - req.flow\n        - req.voice\n    - id: layer.ui\n      role: overlays\n      description: Intro, hint, result, confetti\n      space:\n        kind: screen\n        description: screen\n      content_form:\n        kind: flat_2d\n        description: flat_2d\n      requirement_refs:\n        - req.flow\n    - id: layer.camera\n      role: backdrop\n      description: Camera feed\n      space:\n        kind: screen\n        description: screen\n      content_form:\n        kind: camera_feed\n        description: camera_feed\n      requirement_refs:\n        - req.camera\n  verification:\n    - id: ver.voice\n      description: \"Editor test: ExternalFile AudioComponent plays macOS say recordings of the words; logs\n        show KeywordHit per word and the gates advance\"\n      requirement_refs:\n        - req.voice\n        - req.flow\n        - req.camera\n      views_or_states:\n        - intro\n        - listening\n        - passing\n        - result\n      success_criteria: |-\n        each word advances one gate\n        result after nineteen\n        camera feed visible\n  fallbacks:\n    unknown_requirement: adapt_and_verify\n    unmet_must: stop_and_explain\nplan_type: game\n",
    "template": {
      "status": "none",
      "rationale": "No catalog template covers a voice keyword gate sequence over a painted road; build from scratch reusing the Mamamy brand kit, record-start and result patterns from Game 1/2.",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-28T09:02:04.696Z"
    },
